      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1958196594202845487",
      "text": "[4:53PM] #EbuteEro #Apongbon #TrafficUpdate \n\nMovement descending from CMS Bridge inward Offin Canal is slow, largely due to market activities and heavy influx. However, traffic eases immediately after Offin Canal towards Eko Bridge by NEPA, where movement is smooth.\n\nTraffic flow on Eko Bridge by NEPA inward CMS Bridge is good.\nDescending from Carter Bridge inward Ebute-Ero Market, through Leventis and UBA Roundabout to connect both inner and outer Marina, movement is smooth.\n\nThere is slow traffic along Broad Street, stretching to Apongbon underbridge to connect Offin Canal Market.\nAt present, no major impediments are recorded. Our traffic personnel are on ground managing the situation effectively.\n\n#FollowLASTMA",
